  "notes": "XCMG official bilingual spec sheet obtained from dealer site (not xcmg.com). Chart icons: boom 12.4-47.5 m, outriggers 8.075 m x 7.9 m, 360°, counterweight 11.5 t (max; combinations 11.5/8/3.5/2.2 t). Notes p.17: rated loads include hook block and slings (80 t hook block 994 kg, 40 t 560 kg, 7 t hook 251 kg). Max outrigger reaction at max lifting load 739 kN (p.4) = 75.4 t. Axle positions from carrier front: side-view chain 2155 (boom/hook ahead of carrier) + 3030 front overhang + 1470 + 4000 + 1350 wheelbase + 2545 rear overhang = carrier 12395 mm; overall length 14770 mm. Transport height: drawing D = 3795 mm, technical data table gives 14770x2800x3890 mm (3890 used in table; drawing value stored). Tail swing: table gives 4670 mm at counterweight (4220 mm at aux winch); drawing shows R4070 - table counterweight value stored. Total vehicle mass in travel configuration 50 t (12/12/13/13 t) with 1.3 t counterweight on deck. Longitudinal span 8.975 m also shown on drawing (front outrigger swung further); chart uses 8.075 m. Max hook height: fully-extended boom hoist height 47.5 m per data table. Chart header 'T 11.85~55m' printed on page is a template artefact; boom icon states 12.4-47.5 m."
